    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive and Thrive in the World of Float Energy \u2013 Build Your Sky Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>simulation game</strong> that combines <strong>trade, pet breeding, survival, and combat</strong>, bringing you into a mysterious world suspended above the sea!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive in the Floating Energy World \u2013 Build Your Sky Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where only the <strong>ocean and Sky Islands</strong> exist, <strong>Float Energy</strong> is the key to survival!<br>Your goal is to <strong>prevent your Sky Island from falling</strong> by trading, battling, and completing quests to obtain <strong>precious Float Stones</strong> and build your <strong>sky empire!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade hundreds of goods</strong> and become a trading tycoon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on commissions</strong> and challenge various missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle relentless raiders</strong> or embrace piracy and plunder resources for yourself!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breed the Most Powerful Pets to Protect Your Sky Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, pets are not just adorable companions\u2014they are your greatest allies in battle!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique skills and Blessings\u00a0</strong>allow you to form the ultimate pet army</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breed powerful bloodlines</strong> and create the ultimate mythical beast!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build &amp; Upgrade Your Sky Island \u2013 Create the Perfect Survival Base!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new facilities</strong> to enhance the functionality of your Sky Island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Float Energy Furnace system</strong> and strategically arrange components to generate maximum floating energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the unknown</strong>, endure <strong>floating tides</strong>, and face the ever-present threat of raiders!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple and intuitive trading system</strong> \u2013 freely grow your economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable yet strategic combat</strong> \u2013 use cute pets to fend off enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse facility upgrades</strong> \u2013 expand your Sky Island with limitless possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Float Energy Furnace system</strong> \u2013 test your resource management and layout skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding world</strong> \u2013 unlock more facilities and discover powerful pets as you progress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for the ultimate Sky Island survival challenge? Enter the world of float Energy and build your Sky Island now!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
